@startuml new-use-case
!include _theme.iuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Person" as Person
participant "Agent" as Agent
participant "CLI" as CLI
database "Templates" as Templates
database "Project" as Project

Person -> Agent : "Add the use case cancelOrder"
Agent -> CLI : new use-case cancelOrder --actor Customer
CLI -> Project : next free identifier (UC-xxx)
CLI -> Templates : card and specification
CLI -> Project : write the files that do not exist yet
CLI -> Project : refresh the use-case index
CLI --> Agent : report: created, skipped, index
Agent -> Project : fill the card from what the person said
Agent -> CLI : check
CLI --> Agent : errors and warnings
Agent --> Person : files, open questions, what was not checked
@enduml
